Icons

The tab strip (crates/ui) draws Lucide's "x" and "plus" icons from their path coordinates, and
Folder Compare (crates/ui-folder-compare) draws "x" and "arrow-up-right" the same way. All three
are among the Lucide icons derived from the Feather project. The toolbar (crates/ui) draws Lucide's
"sliders-horizontal" icon the same way; it is Lucide's own, under the ISC License alone. The
Folder Compare view (crates/ui-folder-compare) draws Lucide's "chevron-right" and "chevron-down"
icons the same way for closed and open folders; both are derived from the Feather project.
Text Compare's toolbar arrows (crates/ui) draw Lucide's "arrow-up" and "arrow-down" icons the
same way; both are derived from the Feather project.

The app icon (assets/app-icon) draws Lucide's "git-compare-arrows" icon, scaled, in white on a
blue tile.

